    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for <ref refid="namespaceNeoFOAM" kindref="compound">NeoFOAM</ref> functionObjects that produce scalar time-series output. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Inherits Foam::functionObject so that OpenFOAM&apos;s runtime selection table (RTST) can instantiate derived classes directly from controlDict: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">functions</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>myForces</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type<sp/><sp/><sp/>neoForces;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>libs<sp/><sp/><sp/>(<ref refid="namespaceNeoFOAM" kindref="compound">NeoFOAM</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Derived classes implement:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1FunctionObjectIO_1a2a135997dc8957415c3077e11b22557c" kindref="member">execute()</ref> — runs GPU computation each time-step</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1FunctionObjectIO_1aa9637f114abb9f1fbf8badbab17d2771" kindref="member">write()</ref> — writes the scalar result to postProcessing/ at write intervals</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>GPU-aware I/O strategy</title><para>The intent is that GPU computation in <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1FunctionObjectIO_1a2a135997dc8957415c3077e11b22557c" kindref="member">execute()</ref> reduces an entire field to O(1) scalars, which are then transferred to host and written to disk by <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1FunctionObjectIO_1aa9637f114abb9f1fbf8badbab17d2771" kindref="member">write()</ref>. Full field copies to host are never performed inside <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1FunctionObjectIO_1a2a135997dc8957415c3077e11b22557c" kindref="member">execute()</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
